Immune= buildings (CABHUT) take no damage.

BuildingTypeDef gains Immune= (rules loader, default no), honoured by every
building damage path: direct fire (world_an/world_depth call sites), splash
(damage_area), ability blasts (ability_damage_building), superweapon/shrapnel
(an_damage_building); the AI will not pick them as a target
(unit_can_damage_building). Save format 69. Test in test_gap_combat.cpp:
ability path leaves the hut at full HP while a control takes damage, and a
live tank firing on the hut for 120 frames never scratches it.

